kin-guacamole (1.1.0-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Move all Kin integration into the external package.
  * Add the Kin 2.1 native module, ticketed browser tunnel, dynamic manual,
    externally supervised service, command, application, and nginx route.

 -- Kin <packages@os-kin.com>  Wed, 22 Jul 2026 12:00:00 +0000

kin-guacamole (1.0.0-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release as Kin Remote Desktop Gateway.
  * Embedded Guacamole protocol daemon with Kin IPC integration.
  * Supports VNC, RDP, SSH, Telnet, and Kubernetes protocols.
  * Admin web app for connection and session management.
  * Auto-fetches and builds libguac from Apache guacamole-server.

 -- Kin <packages@os-kin.com>  Mon, 26 May 2026 12:00:00 +0000
